Dear ,
 
Please take this e-mail as confirmation that your training has been booked for [insert date and time].  The training session is expected to take between 45 and 60 minutes. 
 
We request that you check for compatibility of rich media players for Universal Communications Format (UCF) before you join the session. UCF allows you to view multimedia during the session. To check now, click the following link:
 
https://monster-meetings.webex.com/monster-meetings/systemdiagnosis.php
 
Please check that you have the recommended version of Java installed, you can check this by following the link below and selecting ‘Verify Java Version’:
 
http://www.java.com/en/download/installed.jsp
 
You will receive an e-mail with login instructions approximately 30 minutes before the session begins. The invitation will include a Webex weblink and teleconference number, which you will need to click and dial to allow access to the web-based training conference. It may take a few minutes to install the session software on your computer. Please make allowances for this before the training start time. 
 
Please note that occasionally the e-mail can sometimes filter into spam folders, therefore please check your spam folder should you not receive the e-mail.
 
If you have not received login instructions 10 minutes before the session is due to begin, please call us using the numbers below.  
 
I hope this information is helpful. Should you need any further assistance, please do not hesitate to contact me.
 
Kind Regards